WEBVTT

00:00:00.460 --> 00:00:03.350
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:10.620
This never-ending LOOP,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.840
a cycle that goes out of spin,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.270
and runs towards you.

00:00:20.780 --> 00:00:23.740
Under this bright sunlight,

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.040
and blue sky,

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:30.540
I’m accelerating so fast that I can’t stop moving.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.690
It’s my first time having these feelings.

00:00:35.890 --> 00:00:40.450
What should I do? My throbbing heart doesn’t know,

00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:46.590
and keeps searching for the solution, even now.

00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:49.720
KISS! KISS! I’m in love.

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:53.400
I am here because of your kiss,

00:00:53.450 --> 00:00:56.350
which has stopped the flow of time.

00:00:56.520 --> 00:00:59.870
I knock on the door to your heart,

00:01:00.010 --> 00:01:02.870
and watch your wavering dreams.

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:06.640
Your RUBY eyes are what absorb me in.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.550
Barely in sight,

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:15.880
the translucent door to your heart looks like it is opening now.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.400
Only you...

00:01:21.560 --> 00:01:23.830
my kiss will reach...

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.000
Hoshino-san.

00:01:45.870 --> 00:01:47.330
Ah, Sanada-kun.

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:49.670
Do you have library duty now?

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:53.130
Yeah, what about your club, Sanada-kun?

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:54.590
It's canceled today,

00:01:54.590 --> 00:01:58.510
Hiiragi said that he's editing that short movie we filmed.

00:01:59.930 --> 00:02:00.470
I see.

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:04.350
Well, I'll see you tomorrow.

00:02:04.970 --> 00:02:06.930
Okay, see you tomorrow.

00:02:11.650 --> 00:02:13.770
"Well, I'll see you tomorrow,"

00:02:13.770 --> 00:02:15.110
is wrong, isn't it?!

00:02:16.570 --> 00:02:19.280
What are you doing all of a sudden, Mao-neechan?

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:22.830
Why are you simply going home?

00:02:22.830 --> 00:02:25.490
You should've said, "I'll wait until you finish your library duties,

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.120
so we can go home together," right?

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:30.750
Ah, but it might bother her.

00:02:31.380 --> 00:02:32.590
Listen,

00:02:33.340 --> 00:02:36.760
It's been a month since we went to karaoke with everyone, a month!

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.550
I even created a chance for you.

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:42.140
It'll all go to waste if you don't go anywhere with it, right?

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:44.890
Don't hesitate on the first step,

00:02:44.890 --> 00:02:45.470
okay?

00:02:47.930 --> 00:02:48.020
Beautiful Japanese Pronunciation

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:53.400
You're horribly mistaken if you think you have unlimited time.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.860
Yuumi-chan is cute,

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:01.950
if you continue lingering about, she'll be taken by other people.

00:03:04.490 --> 00:03:05.200
Mao-neechan,

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:07.700
do you have someone you like?

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:09.660
W-What is it so suddenly?

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.080
No, I was just wondering how it is for you.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:15.290
I don't have anyone in mind, at the moment.

00:03:15.920 --> 00:03:19.090
You're always saying that you don't want a year full of entrance exams.

00:03:19.970 --> 00:03:23.140
You said that we should enjoy our time by having fun and experiencing love.

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:25.470
Forget about me,

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:27.520
I'll eventually find someone nice.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.940
Isn't that different from what you told me?

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:34.770
I think a third year like you is the one with limited time.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.270
I know that already!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:38.190
I-

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:42.820
They came again.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.910
D-Don't tell me, they're love letters?

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.620
To Mao-chan

00:03:46.950 --> 00:03:48.410
They're so troublesome.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.250
They come everyday.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:52.040
E-Everyday?!

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:54.170
You should understand now.

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:58.630
If I ever felt like it, I could find someone right away.

00:03:58.630 --> 00:04:01.010
Instead of worrying about me, you should think about yourself.

00:04:03.760 --> 00:04:08.640
Geez, you and Kazuki are a real handful.

00:04:09.180 --> 00:04:10.220
Ah, Kazuki,

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:12.480
What are you doing?

00:04:13.100 --> 00:04:14.600
Ah, nothing.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.570
Sanada-kun!

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.190
Sakino-san!

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:22.400
Have you seen Aihara-kun?

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.820
Ah, shoot.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:24.820
If you're looking for Kazuki, then...

00:04:24.820 --> 00:04:26.200
I found you!

00:04:28.410 --> 00:04:31.120
I told you we're having a practice match today!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:33.330
I won't let you skip!

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:37.630
H-Hey, today, the last episode of Harusuna is airing.

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:40.300
N-No, not that, there are some Movie Research Club activities.

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:42.380
The Movie Research Club is taking the day off.

00:04:42.380 --> 00:04:44.470
Sanada-kun was right there, wasn't he?!

00:04:42.510 --> 00:04:46.090
Kouichi, Mao-neechan, later.

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:46.090
Give it up!

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.970
If I recall, that girl was in the Soccer Club.

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:53.060
Oh, she's Sakino Asuka-san.

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:54.140
She's in the same class as us.

00:04:54.600 --> 00:04:57.770
She chases him down pretty often.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:04:59.690
What a serious manager.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.400
Sakino-san isn't the manager.

00:05:02.400 --> 00:05:03.070
Eh?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.290
She was a player?

00:05:16.290 --> 00:05:18.540
She's really good!

00:05:19.590 --> 00:05:21.920
Side midfielder, move up the line!

00:05:21.920 --> 00:05:24.300
Hey, you, don't be so stiff with the ball!

00:05:25.130 --> 00:05:27.550
She seems to be the one in charge of the Soccer Club.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.430
Like the captain of the team, I guess?

00:05:31.680 --> 00:05:34.100
Sakino-senpai!

00:05:34.100 --> 00:05:35.390
You're fabulous!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:40.610
It looks like she already has a fan club among the first years.

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:42.070
Nana-chan and the others...

00:06:02.960 --> 00:06:03.670
I did it!

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:07.090
She certainly is pretty cool.

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:11.600
She can't participate in official games though, because she's a girl.

00:06:11.600 --> 00:06:13.350
Eh, is that so?

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.220
Even though she's the best?

00:06:15.220 --> 00:06:18.190
It's because our school doesn't have a girl's Soccer Club.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:19.480
I see.

00:06:21.520 --> 00:06:23.360
I wanted to see Harusuna.

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:25.650
That's the one with that kiss scene, right?

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:29.150
Were you the type of person to watch love dramas, Aihara?

00:06:29.150 --> 00:06:31.490
Eh, ah, I've been getting into it lately.

00:06:31.490 --> 00:06:32.240
He's there!

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:33.490
Ah, shoot!

00:06:35.160 --> 00:06:37.330
Hey, what are you spacing out for?!

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:39.960
Pull it together, onii-chan!

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:41.080
Lame.

00:06:41.540 --> 00:06:44.040
He's got no motivation, does he?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.420
Yeah.

00:06:49.800 --> 00:06:52.510
You were so cool, Sakino-senpai!

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.270
Juliet also says you're the best!

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:57.980
The best!

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.440
Thanks.

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:04.820
It feels like I've done a year's worth of exercise.

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.610
What are you saying?

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.360
You didn't even run around half as much as Asuka-chan did.

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:10.030
She's got a point.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.780
Even if you compare us, she's still a regular.

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:15.830
Who's a regular?!

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.910
It's because you don't practice seriously!

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:23.460
I'm happy with just being able to have fun playing soccer once in a while.

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:26.170
I don't have any aspirations to become a regular or anything.

00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:27.960
That's problematic then!

00:07:27.960 --> 00:07:30.880
Our team is short on defenders!

00:07:31.260 --> 00:07:32.340
U-Um...

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:39.100
A-Are you and Aihara-senpai...

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:42.440
Going out?

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:43.480
Huh?!

00:07:43.850 --> 00:07:45.060
Eh?!

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:46.860
Really, really?!

00:07:47.360 --> 00:07:50.070
I-Idiot, don't joke around!

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:51.860
Who'd want to go out with this soccer freak!

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.780
Sorry for being a soccer freak!

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.450
I wouldn't want to go out with you either!

00:07:56.740 --> 00:07:59.080
Oh, is that so?!

00:07:59.080 --> 00:08:01.120
You're popular after all,

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.330
with girls!

00:08:02.500 --> 00:08:06.250
And have you ever been popular, even once?!

00:08:06.250 --> 00:08:09.090
Hey, even I have-

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:11.800
Even you?

00:08:12.840 --> 00:08:14.430
What, Kazuki?

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.550
You have a girl like that, too?

00:08:15.760 --> 00:08:18.260
A-Ah, no, I don't.

00:08:18.260 --> 00:08:20.890
You're acting kind of suspicious.

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.100
Talk to me about it.

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:25.520
I'll take care of both you and Kouichi.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:27.900
Both me and Kouichi?

00:08:29.570 --> 00:08:32.860
No, you don't need to move the discussion to me.

00:08:33.950 --> 00:08:36.820
If only I was a bit more like a girl...

00:08:36.820 --> 00:08:40.540
You probably have a boyfriend, right, Mizusawa-senpai?

00:08:40.540 --> 00:08:41.160
Eh?!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:44.160
W-Well, it doesn't matter, right?

00:08:45.710 --> 00:08:48.750
They sure have a lot going for them, huh?

00:08:49.250 --> 00:08:51.550
Let's do our best too, Nana-chan!

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.840
You're right, let's find ourselves a wonderful boyfriend!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:56.300
Yeah!

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:18.370
Sorry, did you wait long?

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:19.320
Ah, I just got here.

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.080
Really, let's go then.

00:09:21.080 --> 00:09:21.830
Where to?

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.040
I feel like eating something.

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:23.700
All right, then.

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:26.120
SANADA

00:09:28.880 --> 00:09:31.040
They could've handed it to me personally,

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.090
instead of putting it inside my shoe locker.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.800
Sorry, but, I don't things like this.

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:45.640
I think a third year like you is the one with limited time.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:50.610
That Kouichi sure said something to make me worry about.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:09.330
Eiji, you can go up now!

00:10:10.420 --> 00:10:11.130
Okay!

00:10:20.090 --> 00:10:21.050
The experiment is over.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.560
I haven't spoken to her once since then.

00:10:25.060 --> 00:10:27.940
Or rather, I couldn't bring myself talk to her.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.120
Kibina High School

00:10:53.750 --> 00:10:54.550
Futami-san...

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:58.630
Do you have a moment?

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.350
On that short test the other day,

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:06.100
you handed in a blank paper again, right?

00:11:06.970 --> 00:11:08.930
I just didn't feel like answering the questions.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:13.060
If you keep doing this, it'll just be to your disadvantage.

00:11:13.060 --> 00:11:14.440
Even the evaluation of your grades...

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:15.690
I don't mind.

00:11:16.280 --> 00:11:18.030
Please evaluate the one I handed in.

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:19.530
Futami-san.

00:11:20.070 --> 00:11:21.070
Excuse me.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:28.870
She handed in a blank paper again.

00:11:29.120 --> 00:11:31.040
As expected from a girl genius.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.120
She's really despicable.

00:11:32.120 --> 00:11:33.210
It can't be helped.

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:36.630
We live in a different world from her.

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.970
Futami-san!

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:44.640
Um... Class is going to start soon.

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.560
I don't feel well.

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:49.850
I'm going to rest in the nurse's office.

00:11:50.180 --> 00:11:51.440
Is that so?

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:54.770
Would you like me to accompany you?

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:56.360
I'm fine.

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:00.530
Take care.

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:06.330
I-I made it somehow.

00:12:10.660 --> 00:12:11.750
Mao-neechan!

00:12:12.410 --> 00:12:13.250
I'm going to head out first!

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:16.540
Go ahead.

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:21.470
He didn't really have to go first.

00:12:21.470 --> 00:12:23.260
That wasn't nice at all.

00:12:25.260 --> 00:12:26.300
Crap...

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.430
My head is spinning.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:33.190
No way...

00:12:37.110 --> 00:12:38.730
So troublesome.

00:12:42.950 --> 00:12:44.030
Kai-kun.

00:12:45.320 --> 00:12:46.160
Thanks.

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:51.120
Love letters?

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:52.540
Looks like it.

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:56.000
If you don't like it, you should just clearly reject them.

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.000
That's true but,

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.090
I start to think of the feelings of the people that gave me these.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:04.170
Hey, are you all right?

00:13:05.720 --> 00:13:07.180
I'm really weak in the mornings,

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.100
maybe I should go rest in the nurse's office.

00:13:11.850 --> 00:13:12.810
The nurse's office, right?

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.140
It's okay, it's okay, I can go alone.

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:18.690
You're light-headed, right?

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.520
Hold on to me.

00:13:19.520 --> 00:13:21.780
You'll be late for class, Kai-kun.

00:13:22.730 --> 00:13:23.320
It's okay.

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.280
Thank you.

00:13:30.280 --> 00:13:31.740
Here will be fine.

00:13:32.240 --> 00:13:33.160
Sorry.

00:13:37.960 --> 00:13:41.380
Sorry, please let me use a bed.

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.130
Hello?

00:13:45.920 --> 00:13:47.680
Tajima-sensei isn't here right now.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:49.470
I see.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.470
You can just take the one beside me.

00:13:52.140 --> 00:13:54.140
Then, I guess I'll do that.

00:13:57.310 --> 00:13:58.940
Do you have low blood pressure too?

00:13:59.810 --> 00:14:02.480
Not really, I just don't feel like going to class.

00:14:03.730 --> 00:14:05.150
I know what you mean.

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.110
I can't stand it in the morning,

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:09.320
especially physics and math.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.750
I'm Mizusawa Mao from 3-A,

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.910
nice to meet you.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:16.580
And you are?

00:14:17.120 --> 00:14:18.830
2-C, Futami Eriko.

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:20.920
Futami Eriko...

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.300
That's an unusual last name.

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.590
What characters do you use for "Futami?"

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.340
Did I ask something weird?

00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:33.810
No.

00:14:34.770 --> 00:14:36.100
Futami means "to look twice."

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.390
Eh, really?

00:14:39.140 --> 00:14:42.270
Futami Eri-chan is a regular skipper.

00:14:42.270 --> 00:14:43.730
You probably don't like studying, right?

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.780
I understand!

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.940
We might see each other here again, then.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:49.450
Perhaps.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.330
You canceled it?!

00:14:53.330 --> 00:14:56.040
Yeah, I realized while I was editing it...

00:14:56.870 --> 00:14:59.250
It just seemed to lack some reality.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:03.210
Well, it was a movie about friendship with Gyouza and Wantan.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.250
You should've realized it while we were filming!

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:07.880
As a result from giving it some thought,

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:10.590
I think I'll be able to bring out my abilities,

00:15:10.590 --> 00:15:12.390
if I devote myself to becoming a producer.

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:14.350
And that's where you come in, Sanada.

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.180
I was thinking of letting you handle the screenplay for our next project.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:18.730
Eh?!

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:23.230
Put all your feelings into it.

00:15:23.230 --> 00:15:24.940
Of course, if you're able to do it,

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:27.110
I intend to have a screening during the school festival.

00:15:27.570 --> 00:15:30.110
Well, even if you tell me this so suddenly...

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:31.570
I think it's a good idea.

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:33.160
Give it a try, Kouichi.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:33.570
Eh?

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.450
You want to become a novelist, right?

00:15:36.450 --> 00:15:39.040
I think writing a screenplay will be educational.

00:15:40.210 --> 00:15:42.120
Screenplays and novels are different!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:45.000
Besides, I've never actually tried to write a novel before.

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:47.500
Then, isn't this the perfect chance for you?

00:15:49.590 --> 00:15:51.300
Using this movie as a chance,

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.890
might open your path to becoming a dazzling future as a novelist.

00:15:57.720 --> 00:15:59.390
Well, I'll leave it at that.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.100
Hand me the synopsis within a month.

00:16:02.100 --> 00:16:02.940
I'm counting on you.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:03.900
H-Hey!

00:16:05.190 --> 00:16:06.730
Give it up.

00:16:06.730 --> 00:16:09.900
Well, rather than Hiiragi's ridiculous scenarios,

00:16:09.900 --> 00:16:12.070
I can trust yours more.

00:16:12.070 --> 00:16:12.610
But...

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.570
Want me to help you think of some ideas?

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.830
Did you see Harusuna? It's a real tear jerker!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.960
How about we think of a story during lunch bre-

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:23.870
Hold on there.

00:16:25.460 --> 00:16:29.630
You said you'd help me train privately during lunch break, didn't you?

00:16:30.090 --> 00:16:32.300
Ah, did I?!

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:36.050
Did you forget that I treated you to ice cream on the way home yesterday?

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:38.510
If you're going to break your promise, pay me back 100 yen!

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.270
I-I got it, I'll go.

00:16:41.270 --> 00:16:43.140
A screenplay, huh?

00:16:45.150 --> 00:16:46.940
Are you all right, Mizusawa-san?

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.110
It must be tough having low blood pressure.

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.150
Yeah, I'm fine now.

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.360
Sorry for making you worry.

00:17:10.460 --> 00:17:12.920
No good, it's just not coming together.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:21.220
That's right, if it's Hoshino-san.

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.930
No, that'd be too sudden, huh?

00:17:25.140 --> 00:17:28.480
You're horribly mistaken if you think you have unlimited time.

00:17:30.020 --> 00:17:31.860
Don't hesitate on the first step.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:35.240
Hoshino-san!

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:37.490
Sanada-kun.

00:17:38.780 --> 00:17:39.780
Do you have something to do now?

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.250
Yeah, I have library duty now for lunch break.

00:17:43.910 --> 00:17:45.120
Ah, I see.

00:17:46.290 --> 00:17:49.420
Um, I wanted to consult with you about something, Hoshino-san.

00:17:50.670 --> 00:17:51.380
With me?

00:17:52.710 --> 00:17:55.510
It's been decided that I'm going to write the screenplay,

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:56.840
for the Movie Research Club's next movie.

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.010
I can't think of any ideas though.

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:03.350
You've read various books,

00:18:03.350 --> 00:18:06.520
so I was wondering if you could help me.

00:18:07.560 --> 00:18:08.600
Are you okay with me?

00:18:09.060 --> 00:18:11.770
Yeah, I want you to help me, Hoshino-san.

00:18:15.030 --> 00:18:18.070
I'm not sure if I'll be of any help,

00:18:19.070 --> 00:18:21.490
but if you're okay with me, then I'll be delighted to.

00:18:22.160 --> 00:18:23.200
What a relief.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:26.160
Then can we talk about it in the library?

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.410
Yes.

00:18:27.960 --> 00:18:29.960
What kind of story were you planning on writing?

00:18:32.000 --> 00:18:33.920
Well, I haven't thought of anything yet.

00:18:34.750 --> 00:18:37.920
Geez, why do I have to practice during lunch break.

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:52.860
Futami-san!

00:18:57.030 --> 00:18:57.530
What?

00:18:57.940 --> 00:18:58.860
Um.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.990
Ah, um, I don't really want anything but.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:03.030
I see.

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:05.450
That experiment!

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.540
Are you, um,

00:19:09.160 --> 00:19:11.170
doing it with some other guy?

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:14.090
It doesn't concern you.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:16.420
Y-You're right,

00:19:17.090 --> 00:19:17.710
sorry.

00:19:24.890 --> 00:19:28.060
Dammit, why did I do that?

00:19:33.860 --> 00:19:36.230
Hey, come at me more seriously!

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.400
Eh, yeah.

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:40.820
This isn't a practice at all.

00:19:40.820 --> 00:19:42.530
You should be tough on defense, and-

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:44.910
Hey, let's stop here for today.

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:45.580
Eh?

00:19:46.740 --> 00:19:49.000
Why me, anyways?

00:19:49.620 --> 00:19:52.540
There are a lot of better guys who are able to practice with you.

00:19:54.710 --> 00:19:56.340
You were able to stop my dribble.

00:19:59.670 --> 00:20:01.670
It was during the first practice match we entered.

00:20:02.930 --> 00:20:05.800
That was the first time someone stopped me so perfectly.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:09.970
If we did it together, it'd be practice for you too, right?

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:13.060
You have talent, so you could become a regular in no time.

00:20:13.060 --> 00:20:15.860
That's impossible, it was pure luck.

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.570
And besides, I hate practicing.

00:20:19.570 --> 00:20:21.490
I'll pay you back the 100 yen later,

00:20:21.490 --> 00:20:22.610
that should be okay, right?

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:27.160
Why? You can become better.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:28.910
You can even enter matches.

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:33.160
No matter how good I become, I can't enter matches!

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:38.090
Don't you regret doing all of this so halfheartedly?!

00:20:43.170 --> 00:20:43.880
Fine,

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:46.090
I'll practice by myself.

00:20:52.390 --> 00:20:53.940
Well, see you tomorrow!

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:57.650
Kai-kun.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.280
Thanks for this morning.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:06.950
Do you have any plans for next Sunday, Mizusawa?

00:21:07.740 --> 00:21:09.780
Eh, Sunday?

00:21:11.290 --> 00:21:12.950
Not really.

00:21:15.080 --> 00:21:16.580
Would you like to go out with me?

00:21:17.290 --> 00:21:17.920
Eh?

00:21:18.960 --> 00:21:20.090
Does that mean...

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:21.710
It's okay if you can't.

00:21:29.970 --> 00:21:30.810
Sure.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
kowaresou de

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:35.060
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.020
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:39.020
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.730
wasarenai yo

00:21:39.360 --> 00:21:41.730
I won’t forget

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.490
hoshi ni negai o

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:47.490
that wish upon a star.

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:00.210
kyou shitsu no sumi ni wa itsumo fushigi bako

00:21:55.710 --> 00:22:00.210
The strange box lying in the corner of the classroom;

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.590
dare ni mo misenai shi

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:02.590
I won’t show it to anyone.

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.380
itsumo minai furi

00:22:02.960 --> 00:22:05.380
I always pretend not to see it.

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:11.300
hajimete okutte moratta hoshi no yoru

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:11.300
The first time you walked me home during that starry night.

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:13.680
ano kajitsu mo

00:22:11.300 --> 00:22:13.680
The fruit

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.270
mada tabetenai kedo

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:16.270
I have not eaten.

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.100
honki de butsukatta

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:19.100
I struck it with all my might.

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
naite sawaida

00:22:19.690 --> 00:22:21.900
I cried and I screamed.

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:30.410
shinkei wa kitto kinui totokoutetsu de dekiteta

00:22:22.110 --> 00:22:30.410
I’m certain nerves are made from silk and steel.

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:33.030
osaekirenai

00:22:30.740 --> 00:22:33.030
My insuppressible feelings

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.040
omoi o nagete negai boshi ni

00:22:33.330 --> 00:22:37.040
are cast on a wishing star.

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.670
ima kakeru yo

00:22:37.290 --> 00:22:38.670
It’s now time to run.

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.090
tobira no soto wa DAIAMONDO

00:22:38.830 --> 00:22:42.090
Beyond the door are diamonds.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:48.050
ikusen no yume kaki utsushita NOOTO ni

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:48.050
Thousands of dreams transcribed onto a notebook.

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.140
tojikometara ai ni yuku yo

00:22:48.300 --> 00:22:53.140
Whenever I’m trapped I’m go see you.

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:59.100
kirakira toeien o kiritotta mamade

00:22:53.140 --> 00:22:59.100
The sparkle and eternity are cut short.

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.070
yakusoku shita kimi to nara ano hi no KISU o

00:22:59.350 --> 00:23:04.070
We made a promise with a kiss on that day.

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.110
kowaresou de

00:23:04.190 --> 00:23:06.110
It looks like it’s about to fall apart.

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
taisetsu sugite sawarenakatta

00:23:06.400 --> 00:23:10.070
So precious that I couldn’t touch it.

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.160
wasurenai yo

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:13.160
I won’t forget

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.120
hoshi ni negai o

00:23:13.830 --> 00:23:19.120
that wish upon a star.

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:40.100
Next Episode

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:28.300
I definitely think onii-chan has been acting weird lately!

00:23:28.300 --> 00:23:31.630
He doesn't listen to me, and becomes all gloomy.

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:34.100
Maybe I should consult Mao-neechan?

00:23:34.100 --> 00:23:36.930
Mao-neechan seems a bit busy though.

00:23:36.930 --> 00:23:38.680
What should I do, Iwao-kun?!
